# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/routing-unavailable
# Switched on, on a reader that turned out not to be able to do it. Each
# switch says it is not available, the runtime's reason is given once, and
# nothing asks for an approval that would lead nowhere.
wait-for Connected
tap Options
wait-for Not available on this reader.
expect Not available here.
expect could not carry traffic for other devices
expect-missing admin console
clean
shot tailscale-routing-unavailable
